{"candidateAnswer":"building custom projects","evidence":"[D23:11 | 9:39 am on 15 October, 2023] Dave: Yeah, Calvin! The crowd had such a buzz. Music brings people together in such an amazing way, and it's just like when I'm fixing up things. I love the feeling of taking something broken and making it whole again. That's why I keep doing what I do.","itemId":"urn:uuid:e4f8f8f8-dd3e-579b-92cc-e1720b38cd81","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:865f55f3d85460d9159f3cb603362170c1bd00bb17989d335494dc52c5ab07ca","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What activity does Dave find fulfilling, similar to Calvin's passion for music festivals?","referenceAnswer":"fixing things","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"865f55f3d85460d9159f3cb603362170c1bd00bb17989d335494dc52c5ab07ca"}}]}